The '''Grinch''' is a {{Rare}} [[Sea Creature]] that can only be fished up in {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}.

== Spawning ==
'''Grinch''' can be fished up from water in the {{Zone|Jerry's Workshop}}. It requires {{Skill|fishing|13}} to be fished up. 

The base [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] for '''Grinch''' is {{Green|1500}}, resulting in a default catch chance of {{Chance|15%|1|6.67|sea creatures}} with all Sea Creatures unlocked. Currently there are no modifiers that can be used to increase it.

