== Strategy ==
Since this sea creature moves very fast, it is recommended to try to get it into the water, then to kill as fast as possible.

== Trivia ==
[[File:Runic Grinch.png|thumb|A Runic Grinch]]
*The name of the sea creature is a reference to Dr. Seuss's book ''How The Grinch Stole Christmas''.
*In popular culture, Grinch has become the likes of an anti-Santa character that steals gifts from people and prevents Christmas from coming to homes.
*When killed, the Grinch gives the player the [[Achievements|Achievement]] "Caught the Grinch". It grants 15 achievement points.
*Similarly to [[Hidden Jerry]]s, they run away from the player, sometimes falling into the void.
*Before the [[Changelog/2026/March_31|0.24.3]] update '''Grinch''' had unique health bar, which resulted in situations where if it was runic or corrupted, health bar would be much larger than normal.
*Strangely, part of the text that appears when fished up can be clicked on, leading to the invalid URL "<nowiki>https://Gifts...get</nowiki>". This is likely a bug.

